msgstr "Convert `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` to `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`."

msgid "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"dynamic-cv-pipeline\">"

msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

msgid "3.2.2.5 DynamicCV 流水优化（Ascend 950）"
msgstr "3.2.2.5 DynamicCV Pipeline Optimization (Ascend 950)"

msgid "DynamicCV 用于优化同时包含 Cube 矩阵计算和 Vector 计算的 kernel。编译器分析数据依赖、划分计算块，并插入多缓冲和核间同步，使可并行的计算与数据搬运交错执行，减少相互等待。"
msgstr "DynamicCV optimizes kernels that contain both Cube matrix computation and Vector computation. The compiler analyzes data dependencies, partitions computation blocks, and inserts multi-buffering and inter-core synchronization. This interleaves the execution of parallelizable computations and data movement, reducing mutual waiting."

msgid "设置 `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True` 后，编译器会尝试应用这项优化。若 kernel 不满足优化条件（例如不包含矩阵乘法），或优化无法完成，编译器会将 IR **回退**到本次优化前的状态，将 `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline` 置为 `False`，并恢复由该优化调整的编译选项，随后继续编译。开关的默认值、关联选项和缓冲槽配置见[编译选项参考表](./environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md#compiler-options-reference)。"
msgstr "After you set `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True`, the compiler attempts to apply this optimization. If the kernel does not meet the optimization conditions (for example, it does not contain matrix multiplication) or the optimization cannot be completed, the compiler **rolls back** the IR to its previous state. The compiler then sets `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline` to `False`, restores the compilation options adjusted by this optimization, and continues the compilation. For the default value of this switch, associated options, and buffer slot configuration, see the [compiler options reference table](./environment_variable_and_compiler_options_reference.md#compiler-options-reference)."

msgid "3.2.3 SIMT 编译器（Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品）"
msgstr "3.2.3 SIMT Compiler (Ascend 950PR&950DT products)"

msgid "Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 在 SIMD 路径之外增加 SIMT 能力，用于加速**非结构化 / 离散**访存（如间接索引的 load/store）。 开发者通过 `compile_mode` 选择编译路径。"
msgstr "Ascend 950PR&950DT products add SIMT capability in addition to the SIMD path to accelerate **unstructured / discrete** memory access (such as indirect indexed load/store). Developers select the compilation path through `compile_mode`."

msgid "3.2.3.1 `compile_mode` 说明"
msgstr "3.2.3.1 `compile_mode` Description"

msgid "`compile_mode`"
msgstr "`compile_mode`"

msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

msgid "编译路径"
msgstr "Compilation Path"

msgid "`\"simd\"`"
msgstr "`\"simd\"`"

msgid "纯 SIMD：结构化访存走 DMA；非结构化走标量循环"
msgstr "Pure SIMD: structured memory access uses DMA; unstructured memory access uses scalar loops"

msgid "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"

msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`（**默认**）"
msgstr "\"simd_simt_template\" (**default**)"

msgid "混合：结构化仍走 SIMD；离散访存尽量走 SIMT 模板"
msgstr "Hybrid: Structured memory access still uses SIMD; discrete memory access uses SIMT templates whenever possible."

msgid "`\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`\"simt_only\"`"

msgid "纯 SIMT：直接下发 Triton IR 给NPU IR处理"
msgstr "Pure SIMT: Directly sends Triton IR to the NPU IR for processing."

msgid "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"

msgid "用法示例："
msgstr "Usage example:"

msgid ""
"# 纯 SIMD\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd\")\n"
"\n"
"# 混合（默认；Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 上离散访存优先走 SIMT）\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\")\n"
"\n"
"# 纯 SIMT\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simt_only\", num_warps=32)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Pure SIMD\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd\")\n"
"\n"
"# Hybrid (default; discrete memory access prioritizes SIMT on Ascend 950PR&950DT products)\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\")\n"
"\n"
"# Pure SIMT\n"
"kernel[grid](..., compile_mode=\"simt_only\", num_warps=32)\n"

msgid "3.2.3.2 三种模式的编译分流"
msgstr "3.2.3.2 Compilation Dispatch for Three Modes"

msgid ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[compile_mode] --> B[\"simd\"]\n"
"    A --> C[\"simd_simt_template\"]\n"
"    A --> D[\"simt_only\"]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simt_only 分支\n"
"    D --> D1[直接下发 Triton IR，纯SIMT编译，Triton IR → AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd 完整链路\n"
"    B --> B1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    B1 --> B2[拆成连续/离散后用 SIMD 方式处理]\n"
"    B2 --> B3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    B3 --> B4[离散访存展开为标量循环]\n"
"    B4 --> B5[TritonToLinalg]\n"
"    B5 --> B6[AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd_simt_template 完整链路\n"
"    C --> C1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    C1 --> C2[满足条件打上标记，下发下层SIMT处理]\n"
"    C2 --> C3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    C3 --> C4{离散访存可转为 indirect_load/store SIMT 模板？}\n"
"    C4 -- 是 --> B5\n"
"    C4 -- 否 --> C5[回退标量循环]\n"
"    C5 --> B5\n"
"\n"
"    %% 样式定义（低饱和度钢蓝 / 青灰 / 中性灰，稳重严肃）\n"
"    classDef root fill:#d6dee8,stroke:#2c4257,stroke-width:2px,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef mode fill:#e4eaf1,stroke:#3c5872,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef pass fill:#eef2f6,stroke:#4d6580,color:#23303d\n"
"    classDef logic fill:#f0f3f2,stroke:#5f7a72,color:#26322d\n"
"    classDef simtOnly fill:#f1f1f1,stroke:#707070,color:#2b2b2b\n"
"\n"
"    %% 绑定样式\n"
"    class A root\n"
"    class B,C mode\n"
"    class B1,C1,B3,C3,B5,B6 pass\n"
"    class B2,B4,C2,C4,C5 logic\n"
"    class D,D1 simtOnly\n"
msgstr ""
"flowchart TD\n"
"    A[compile_mode] --> B[\"simd\"]\n"
"    A --> C[\"simd_simt_template\"]\n"
"    A --> D[\"simt_only\"]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simt_only branch\n"
"    D --> D1[Directly emit Triton IR, pure SIMT compilation, Triton IR → AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd full pipeline\n"
"    B --> B1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    B1 --> B2[Split into contiguous/discrete, then process using SIMD]\n"
"    B2 --> B3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    B3 --> B4[Discrete memory access expanded to scalar loops]\n"
"    B4 --> B5[TritonToLinalg]\n"
"    B5 --> B6[AscendNPU IR]\n"
"\n"
"    %% simd_simt_template full pipeline\n"
"    C --> C1[discrete-mask-access-conversion]\n"
"    C1 --> C2[Mark when conditions are met, dispatch to lower-level SIMT processing]\n"
"    C2 --> C3[triton-to-unstructured]\n"
"    C3 --> C4{Can discrete memory access be converted to indirect_load/store SIMT template?}\n"
"    C4 -- Yes --> B5\n"
"    C4 -- No --> C5[Fallback to scalar loops]\n"
"    C5 --> B5\n"
"\n"
"    %% Style definitions (low-saturation steel blue / slate gray / neutral gray, steady and formal)\n"
"    classDef root fill:#d6dee8,stroke:#2c4257,stroke-width:2px,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef mode fill:#e4eaf1,stroke:#3c5872,color:#1f2d3d\n"
"    classDef pass fill:#eef2f6,stroke:#4d6580,color:#23303d\n"
"    classDef logic fill:#f0f3f2,stroke:#5f7a72,color:#26322d\n"
"    classDef simtOnly fill:#f1f1f1,stroke:#707070,color:#2b2b2b\n"
"\n"
"    %% Bind styles\n"
"    class A root\n"
"    class B,C mode\n"
"    class B1,C1,B3,C3,B5,B6 pass\n"
"    class B2,B4,C2,C4,C5 logic\n"
"    class D,D1 simtOnly\n"

msgid "阶段"
msgstr "Stage"

msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`"
msgstr "`\"simd_simt_template\"`"

msgid "离散 mask 处理"
msgstr "Discrete mask handling"

msgid "拆成连续/离散边界，用 load + select / store 处理"
msgstr "Split into continuous/discrete boundaries, and handle them using load + select / store."

msgid "Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 且张量维数 ≤ 5：标记后交给下游；否则同左"
msgstr "Ascend 950PR&950DT products and tensor dimensionality ≤ 5: marked and passed to the downstream; otherwise, same as left"

msgid "不运行"
msgstr "Do not run"

msgid "非结构化访存"
msgstr "unstructured memory access"

msgid "展开为标量循环"
msgstr "Unroll into a scalar loop"

msgid "尽量转为 SIMT 间接访存（维数 ≤ 5）；失败则回退标量循环"
msgstr "Convert to SIMT indirect memory access (dimensions ≤ 5) where possible; fall back to a scalar loop if conversion fails"

msgid "TritonToLinalg"
msgstr "TritonToLinalg"

msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级"
msgstr "Regular Linalg IR Lowering"

msgid "3.2.3.3 混合模式：只对离散访存走 SIMT"
msgstr "3.2.3.3 Hybrid mode: use SIMT only for discrete memory access"

msgid "混合模式**不会**把整个 kernel 切到 SIMT，只对离散 / 非结构化访存点走 SIMT，其余仍走 SIMD："
msgstr "Hybrid mode **does not** switch the entire kernel to SIMT; it only uses SIMT for discrete / unstructured memory access points, while the rest still uses SIMD:"

msgid "**离散 mask 处理**"
msgstr "**Discrete mask handling**"

msgid "若判定为非连续 mask，且满足 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品、混合模式、维数 ≤ 5：不改写 IR，只标记「下游走 SIMT」。"
msgstr "If the mask is determined to be non-contiguous, and the conditions of Ascend 950PR&950DT products, mixed mode, and dimensionality ≤ 5 are met: do not rewrite the IR, and only mark 'downstream takes the SIMT path'."

msgid "否则（纯 SIMD 或不满足条件）：将 mask 拆成连续 / 离散部分，用连续边界限定全局内存访问，再通过 select 合并结果。"
msgstr "Otherwise (pure SIMD or conditions are not met): split the mask into contiguous/discrete parts, use contiguous boundaries to restrict global memory access, and then merge the results using select."

msgid "**非结构化访存处理**"
msgstr "**Unstructured memory access handling**"

msgid "在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 混合模式下，对非结构化访存或已标记的离散访存走 SIMT 快速通道："
msgstr "In the hybrid mode of Ascend 950PR&950DT products, unstructured memory access or marked scattered memory access uses the SIMT fast path:"

msgid "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`（维数 ≤ 5）"
msgstr "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store` (dimensions ≤ 5)"

msgid "`atomic` 操作 → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"
msgstr "`atomic` operation → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"

msgid "不满足条件则回退为标量循环（与 `\"simd\"` 一致）。"
msgstr "If the condition is not met, it falls back to a scalar loop (consistent with `\"simd\"`)."

msgid "**TritonToLinalg**"
msgstr "**TritonToLinalg**"

msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级。"
msgstr "Conventional Linalg IR lowering."

msgid "3.2.3.4 纯 SIMT（`simt_only`）"
msgstr "3.2.3.4 Pure SIMT (`simt_only`)"

msgid "`simt_only` 直接下发 Triton IR 交给 AscendNPU IR 做纯 SIMT 编译。"
msgstr "`simt_only` directly passes Triton IR to AscendNPU IR for pure SIMT compilation."

msgid "3.2.4 Ascend 亲和算子"
msgstr "3.2.4 Ascend Affinity Operators"

msgid "为表达标准 Triton 无法覆盖的 Ascend 硬件语义（Cube-Vector 跨核协作、UB 数据搬运、硬件特定访存等），后端在 `triton.language` 上扩展了一组 Ascend 亲和算子。按能力分为三类："
msgstr "To express Ascend hardware semantics not covered by standard Triton (Cube-Vector cross-core collaboration, UB data movement, hardware-specific memory access, and so on), the backend extends a set of Ascend-affinitized operators on `triton.language`. These operators are classified into three categories based on their capabilities:"

msgid "代表扩展"
msgstr "Represents the extension"

msgid "架构作用"
msgstr "Architecture Role"

msgid "硬件特定数据搬运"
msgstr "Hardware-specific data movement"

msgid "`extension.custom_op`（`index_select` / `index_put`、`gather_out_to_ub` / `scatter_ub_to_out`、`indirect_load` / `indirect_store` 等）"
msgstr "`extension.custom_op` (`index_select` / `index_put`, `gather_out_to_ub` / `scatter_ub_to_out`, `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`, and so on)"

msgid "支持基于索引的 gather/scatter、GM ↔ Unified Buffer 直传、间接地址访存等硬件特定搬运模式，供 SIMD/SIMT 各编译路径复用。"
msgstr "Supports index-based gather/scatter, direct transfer between GM and Unified Buffer, indirect address memory access, and other hardware-specific data movement modes for reuse across SIMD/SIMT compilation paths."

msgid "编译提示"
msgstr "Compilation Tips"

msgid "`extension.compile_hint`"
msgstr "`extension.compile_hint`"

msgid "向编译器传递硬件特定提示，指导后端优化策略、资源分配与内核配置。"
msgstr "Pass hardware-specific hints to the compiler to guide backend optimization strategies, resource allocation, and kernel configuration."

msgid "跨核块同步"
msgstr "cross-core block synchronization"

msgid "`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / `extension.sync_block_all`"
msgstr "`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / `extension.sync_block_all`"

msgid "显式协调 Cube-Vector 架构下的核间执行顺序与数据依赖：点对点等待 / 通知，以及按模式广播的全局块同步。"
msgstr "Explicitly coordinate inter-core execution order and data dependencies under the Cube-Vector architecture: point-to-point wait/notify, and pattern-based broadcast global block synchronization."

msgid "各扩展的函数签名、参数取值、使用限制与示例以 Python API 参考为准（避免与架构文档两处维护）：见 [triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html)——索引/gather/scatter 等搬运类见 *Vector/Memory Extension Ops*、自定义算子机制见 *Custom Ops*、跨核同步见 *Synchronization*、编译提示与多缓冲见 *Core Types*。"
msgstr "For the function signatures, parameter values, usage restrictions, and examples of each extension, refer to the Python API reference (to avoid maintaining them in both the architecture document and the API reference): see [triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html). For index/gather/scatter and other data movement operations, see *Vector/Memory Extension Ops*; for the custom operator mechanism, see *Custom Ops*; for cross-core synchronization, see *Synchronization*; for compilation hints and multi-buffering, see *Core Types*."
